    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Izabele} to begin the quest.
* Invite at least one other player to form a party of 2. Change to a job that's level 15 or below.
** {p:Trusts|Trust} and {p:Adventuring Fellows|Adventuring Fellow} do not count toward the requirements.
** {p:Level Sync} **does** work.
* Together with your party, travel to {z:North Gustaberg} and locate the galka {n:Hunting Bear} at F-8 (near the waterfall).
** The {p:Survival Guide} also puts you at the {p:Outpost}, which is fairly close to him.
** Any players under level 20 will have to walk, as mounts require level 20.
* Speak with {n:Hunting Bear} to complete the quest.
** You only need to be level synced when you talk to {n:Hunting Bear}, not as you travel to him.

=2 Notes
Similar to {M:When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide}, {p:Mercenary Camp}, and {q:The Kuftal Tour|The Kuftal Tour|The Kuftal Tour}, this CS displays fellow party members, a very rare occurrence.
* It's not much of a different angle than you'd see in game.
* You can watch this CS again with the Goblin Footprint.

Originally this quest required 6 players and required a level 5 or below job, but was dropped to 2 players and a level 15 or below job with the {p:June 2015 Update|https://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/47481-Jun-25-2015-%28JST%29-Version-Update}
* This had an added effect of allowing players who did not have a level 5 or below job to complete the quest with 2008's {p:Level Sync} functionality, as with the previous level cap, you could not sync due to the minimum level for sync being level 10.

